This site is based on Henry Heffernan's portfolio, heavily edited, and takes ideas from Alana Goyal's site.

The room scene is derived from portfolio-website by Henry Heffernan (https://github.com/henryjeff/portfolio-website),
used under the MIT licence below. SaahilOS is derived from portfolio-inner-site by Henry Heffernan
(https://github.com/henryjeff/portfolio-inner-site), used with his permission. The window-to-URL mapping and the phone
layout follow ideas from Alana Goyal's site (https://github.com/alanagoyal/alanagoyal), MIT licence below.

Henry Heffernan's room recordings (room tone, computer, startup, keyboard and mouse) are included, re-encoded, under
the MIT licence below and with his permission. None of his artwork, textures, fonts or icons is included.

The breeze in the room's plants (src/scene/World/Wind.ts) follows the wind in folio-2025 by Bruno Simon
(https://github.com/brunosimon/folio-2025), MIT licence below. The coffee's steam uses classic 2D Perlin noise by
Stefan Gustavson (src/scene/shaders/perlin.glsl, from webgl-noise), MIT licence below.

